// removes the combining diacritics (ä→a, e̞→e, o̞→o, the devoicing rings b̥/ɡ̊/d̥) and the affricate ties; the folds
// below neutralise the remaining NARROW allophony the phonemic g2p does not model: the mid-vowel symbol (e/o→ɛ/ɔ),
// dark ɫ→l, pre-velar n→ŋ, the ვ labialisation glide ʷ→v, ⟨ყ⟩'s narrow [χʼ]→/qʼ/, and final devoicing (v→f, …). The
// three-way stop contrast (ejective ◌ʼ / aspirate ◌ʰ / voiced) and every consonant place ARE compared directly.
